Adeos milestone release M2 is available for download at
http://savannah.gnu.org/download/adeos/releases/adeos-m2.tar.gz.

This is a major release for Linux/x86 completing the stabilization
effort so that ports to other archs are (hopefully) simplified. Among
other things:

- Adeos now supports SMP.
- Exceptions generated by domains (including Linux faults and
syscall traps) can be pipelined to more prioritary domains for
interception.
- The API which allows to implement Adeos "domains" aside of Linux is
now stable and fully documented.

Have fun! :o)

Philippe.

